  "solution": {
    "text": "Since,&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>α</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></math><br />And <math><msup><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>β</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>β</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>β</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>β</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br />So, the required equation is<br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2.1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Sum of roots <math><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>",
